{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-11-19 11:45:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES IN LEGAL FUNCTION', 'text': "MERRILLVILLE, IND., NOV.\xa019, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ANNE-MARIE D'ANGELO, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GENERAL COUNSEL AND CORPORATE SECRETARY, IS LEAVING NISOURCE TO ASSUME THE POSITION OF CHIEF LEGAL AND GOVERNMENT AFFAIRS OFFICER AT MOLSON COORS BEVERAGE COMPANY (NYSE: TAP, TAP.A; TSX: TPX.B, TPX.A)."}